The upper density of a generation algorithm $\calA$ is defined as
    \begin{align*}
        \mu_{\up}^{\el}(\calA, D) &= \inf\left\{\inf_{K\in\calL}\inf_{E\in\calE(K)} \limsup_{i\to\infty} \mu^{\el}_{i}(\calA(E),K,D): \calL \text{ is a countable language collection}\right\}.
    \end{align*}
